        <p class="!m-0 text-center text-[15px] !text-white font-light">Share the love! Please tag your photos and videos with us by using our official hashtag: <strong>#ERIKA</strong>foundherperfect<strong>MATT</strong>ch</p>

        <img src="images/icons/facebook.svg" alt="Facebook" class="w-6 h-6" />
        <img src="images/icons/instagram.svg" alt="Instagram" class="w-6 h-6" />
        <img src="images/icons/tiktok-dark.svg" alt="TikTok" class="w-6 h-6" />
    </footer>
</div>
